        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "For what it's worth, after experimenting with a couple different implementations, this is what I'm currently using:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n// plugin config\r\nstarter.setup({\r\n  ...\r\n  item_is_active = function(item, query)\r\n    return item.name:lower().find(query:lower()) ~= nil and item.action ~= ''\r\n  end\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n// starter.lua\r\nH.make_query = function(buf_id, query, echo_msg)\r\n  local item_is_active = MiniStarter.config.item_is_active or H.item_is_active\r\n\r\n  // replace H.item_is_active calls with item_is_active\r\nend\r\n```",
            "created_at": "2024-11-14T15:54:02Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1338#issuecomment-2476773676",
