        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Nice, I wasn't aware of that one. It seems like it would require a bit more refactoring, though, since it works over the whole list rather than with a single item.\r\n\r\nFor my own use I'm not so concerned with fuzzy matching as just not always matching from the beginning of an item, because the part of a file name or path that really stands out (to me) may not always be at the beginning.",
